theorem exists_comp_eq {K L : Type} [Field K] [Field L] (f : K →+* L) (hf : Function.Surjective f)
    {n : ℕ} (w : Fin n → L) : ∃ v : Fin n → K, f ∘ v = w := by
  choose v hv using fun i => hf (w i)
  exact ⟨v, funext hv⟩

/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the hypotheses and the conclusion using the stated equalities. Establish an intermediate fact. Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

A detailed English derivation is pending.
